# Locally computed (GitHub does not publish signed hashes for commit tarballs --
# standard practice for git/github-sourced Buildroot packages, per
# pkg-download.mk / the Buildroot manual).
#
#   sha256sum aic8800-516e3b087763d80c44f5e3b6d2dd63e0d925c91d.tar.gz
#
# Produced on 2026-09-10 by fetching
# https://github.com/radxa-pkg/aic8800/archive/<VERSION>.tar.gz twice, from a
# cold cache, and confirming the two downloads agreed byte-for-byte
# (55,400,140 bytes both times) -- GitHub generates commit tarballs on demand,
# so a single fetch proves nothing about reproducibility. Recomputed by
# Buildroot on every fetch, so a tampered or rewritten upstream ref fails the
# build rather than being silently accepted.
#
# The tarball is large (55 MiB) because it carries the PCIE and SDIO driver
# trees and the vendor documentation alongside the USB tree this package
# builds. Only src/USB/ is used; nothing prunes the download.
